Subject: [PATCH] Preserve rusqdoltlite history and remote behavior
Base: DoltLite v0.11.28

This patch contains the DoltLite-internal behavior that cannot be implemented
through rusqdoltlite's Rust wrapper:

- discover point-in-time tables and columns across non-current refs;
- support remote set-url and persist pulled and cloned refs;
- preserve meaningful SQLite codes for HTTP failures; and
- distinguish oversized chunk uploads from malformed requests.

